cal area of healthcare.", "HOSPITAL GENERAL UNIVERSITARIO DE ALICANTE:The Hospital General Universitario de Alicante is a healthcare institution that provides a range of medical services. Within this facility, Dr. Ángel Luis Abad González serves as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition, contributing to the hospital's commitment to patient care and specialized medical treatment.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO Y POLITÉCNICO DE LA FE, VALENCIA:Hospital Universitario y Politécnico de La Fe in Valencia is a healthcare institution where Dr. Juan Francisco Merino Torres works as a head of the endocrinology and nutrition service.", "HOSPITAL CLÍNICO UNIVERSITARIO LOZANO BLESAS, ZARAGOZA:Hospital Clínico Universitario Lozano Blesa in Zaragoza is a healthcare institution where Dr. Julia Ocón Bretón works as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO SAN CECILIO, GRANADA:Hospital Universitario San Cecilio in Granada is a healthcare institution where Dr. María Luisa Fernández Soto works as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO MARQUÉS DE VALDECILLA, CANTABRIA:Hospital Universitario Marqués de Valdecilla in Cantabria is a healthcare institution where Dr. Ángela González Díaz-Faes works as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO 12 DE OCTUBRE, MADRID:Hospital Universitario 12 de Octubre in Madrid is a healthcare institution where Dr. Miguel León Sanz works as the head of the endocrinology and nutrition service.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO MIGUEL SERVET, ZARAGOZA:Hospital Universitario Miguel Servet in Zaragoza is a healthcare institution where Dr. Francisco Losfablos Callau works as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition.", "HOSPITAL CLÍNICO UNIVERSITARIO DE VALLADOLID:The Hospital Clínico Universitario de Valladolid is a healthcare institution that serves as a medical facility in Valladolid. It is notable for having Dr. Daniel A. de Luis Román as the head of its endocrinology and nutrition service. This institution is dedicated to providing comprehensive medical care and is recognized for its specialized services in the field of endocrinology and nutrition.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO DE SAN JUAN, ALICANTE:Hospital Universitario de San Juan in Alicante is a healthcare institution where Dr. Rosa Mª Mirete López works as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition.", "HOSPITAL UNIVERSITARIO REINA SOFÍA, CÓRDOBA:Hospital Universitario Reina Sofía in Córdoba is a healthcare institution where Dr. María José Molina Puerta works as a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition.", "HOSPITAL SAN PEDRO, LA RIOJA:Hospital San Pedro in La Rioja is a healthcare institution where Dr. Ángela Martín Palmero works as the head of the clinical nutrition and dietetics unit.", "DRA. MARÍA ARGENTE PLA:Dra. María Argente Pla is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition at Hospital Universitario y Politécnico de La Fe in Valencia. She is known for her expertise in treating patients with diabetes mellitus and cystic fibrosis, providing specialized care to manage these chronic conditions effectively.", "DRA. MARÍA D. BALLESTEROS POMAR:Dra. María D. Ballesteros Pomar is a medical specialist in endocrinology and nutrition, currently practicing at the Complejo Asistencial Universitario de León. She is recognized for her expertise in the field and has contributed to the medical community through her authorship of articles related to diabetes mellitus.", "DR. FERNANDO L. CALVO GRACIA:Dr. Fernando L. Calvo Gracia is a medical specialist in Endocrinology and Nutrition at Hospital Clínico Universitario Lozano Blesa in Zaragoza. He is particularly involved in managing nutritional support for patients with pancreatic tumors, demonstrating his expertise in both endocrinology and nutrition within a clinical setting."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n"